            "text": "<p>Island Living blends the tranquil essence of island life with everyday comfort, offering a sustainable and stylish approach to home decor. <br/><br/>Founded in 2019, the brand quickly gained prominence for its eco-conscious ethos, using sustainable materials like reclaimed teak and natural rattan to create elegant, environmentally friendly interiors that celebrate nature’s raw beauty.<br/><br/>Island Living's design philosophy centers on creating a harmonious blend of textures and finishes. From the rustic charm of natural materials to the sun-kissed elegance of teak or rattan wood, each piece is carefully selected to evoke calm and serenity. Experience the ultimate tropical retreat, where cozy comforts meet the carefree spirit of island life—right here at Island Living.</p>",
