        "text_TVrPPh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2><strong>Shop now, store for later!</strong></h2><p>We know that timing is everything when it comes to furnishing your home. That's why we've extended our free storage period.  Whether you're waiting for renovations to wrap up, planning a big move, or just need a little extra time to get things in order—we've got you covered!</p><p><strong>Enjoy up to 90 days of FREE storage</strong> on your orders, so you can shop now and receive your items when you're ready. No extra fees, no hassle—just total flexibility to suit your schedule.</p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlight_phrases": ""
          }
        },
        "text_A4pHdj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>How It Works:</strong></p><p><strong>1. Shop as usual</strong> and add your favourite pieces to your cart.</p><p><strong>2. Select your preferred delivery date</strong> at checkout—the calendar will show all available dates within the next 90 days.</p><p><strong>3. Relax!</strong> We’ll store your items safely, free of charge, until your chosen delivery date.</p><p><strong>4. Need more time?</strong> If you require storage beyond 90 days, we offer extended storage at 7% of your order value per additional month (or part thereof).</p><p><strong>Think of it as shopping on your terms. No need to rush or worry about where to keep your new finds—we’ll take care of that for you.</strong></p><p>Have questions? Our team is happy to help! Contact us at info@islandliving.sg.</p><p><a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\" title=\"Shipping Policy\">Read our full delivery policy here.</a></p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlight_phrases": ""
          }
